      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a good start, but it feels a bit high-level. i need more \"meat\" for the article. specifically, can you address the common criticisms from the fiscal conservative side? like, how would you respond to people saying it's just going to cause massive inflation or that it's too expensive for the government to actually fund? i want to make sure i can effectively shut down those arguments in my piece.",
